OL,3,GNEWSAMetal detectorist finds
OL,4,A3,000-year-old gold bracelet 'worth up
OL,5,Ato #20k'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHaving only ever found a silver coin
OL,8,Fwhile metal detecting, Idris Thomas was
OL,9,Fshocked to strike gold - a late Bronze
OL,10,FAge gold bracelet which has been
OL,11,Fdeclared treasure.
OL,13,FBelieved to be about 3,000 years old,
OL,14,Fthe bracelet was found to be 92.8% gold
OL,15,Fby experts from Museum Wales. Brett
OL,16,FHammond, CEO of Timeline Auctions,
OL,17,Festimated its value at between #15,000
OL,18,Fand #20,000. An official value has not
OL,19,Fyet been given.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
