OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMetal detectorist finds
OL,4,A3,000-year-old gold bracelet 'worth up
OL,5,Ato #20k'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas was scanning on farmland
OL,8,Fbelonging to Geraint Edwards, in
OL,9,FLlanuwchllyn, Gwynedd, for about 20
OL,10,Fminutes when his detector alerted him.
OL,12,F"I thought it was another bit of tin
OL,13,Ffoil to begin with, and I just saw a
OL,14,Fflash of gold and dug a little bit
OL,15,Faround it," he said.
